* {{audio|en|en-us-foreseen.ogg|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|iːn|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb form}}

# {{inflection of|en|foresee||past|part}}
#: {{co|en|easily '''foreseen'''}}
#: {{ux|en|The crisis could not have been '''foreseen'''.}}
